# DUSKLING M3, HOLLOW LOG (room 3): pink caps over a pit, a prickle in the hollow log, and a frog to spring up the last ledge.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 3
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 17
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 23
hold LEFT+A 7
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 31
hold LEFT+A 7
hold A 12
hold LEFT+A 2
hold A 55
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 4
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 24
wait 2
expect room == 4
